{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwGram","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwGram","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.TwBasisField","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.RegTraceGram"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.isSemisimpleRing_of_twGram_det_ne_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.isSemisimpleRing_of_twGram_det_ne_zero","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwGram.lean#L58-L66","doc":"**`det(Gram) ≠ 0 ⟹ `H_n(q)` is semisimple**, at every rank.\n\nThis is the composition the `RegTraceGram` hook was written for, and it\ncould not be stated before `basisTwOfField`: without a basis there is no\nfinite index set to take the determinant over. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.twGram_apply","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.twGram_apply","kind":"theorem","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwGram.lean#L51-L56","doc":"**The Gram entries are observables**: the `(v, w)` entry is the trace of\nleft multiplication by `T_v T_w`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.twGram","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.TwBasis.twGram","kind":"def","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/TwGram.lean#L44-L49","doc":"**The regular-trace Gram matrix of `H_n(q)` in the `T_w` basis.**\nRows and columns are indexed by `S_{n+1}`, so it is `(n+1)! × (n+1)!`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}